6. Add error handling in the builder/service so that missing or malformed return-trip metadata logs a warning, omits or safely defaults the return discount line, and still sends the email with the outbound discount intact.
7. Ensure locale-aware currency and number formatting is applied to the return-leg discount amount using the same localization path as the outbound leg.
8. Add or extend tests to cover: return trip with distinct per-leg discounts, return trip with multiple line items aggregated, no promo code, zero-value return discount, discount exceeding base fare, missing/malformed metadata, non-English locale, and one-way trip regression.
